skill-model-size-accuracy-tradeoff: fixed (solve.sh used dict key 'name' instead of 'model' -> KeyError)
skill-gpt-2-bpe: fixed (verifier never set reward=1 when python check passed; wrapped in if)
skill-conflict-resolution: fixed (git config before git init -> build exit 128; also solve.sh wrote wrong 'duplicate' content)
skill-tls: fixed (CN parse split on '/' but openssl emits comma form; robust regex in solve+test; None-cn strand)
skill-stan: fixed (pip pystan unavailable on arm64 linux - no httpstan wheel; redesigned to numpy Metropolis-Hastings, same posterior normal-Normal target)
skill-python-c-api: fixed (heredoc opened <<'CEOF' but terminated EOF; made terminator match)
skill-raman-spectroscopy: fixed (oracle solve.sh ran /app/shift.py but never created it; solve now writes+runs it)
item-050-main: fixed (''return 200'' short-circuits before limit_req preaccess phase, so no 429; serve /app/ok.txt via alias; verifier now restarts nginx to reset rate-limit zone and parses status codes robustly)
item-051-main: fixed (verifier expected openssl 3.0-incompatible substrings; DER pubkey comparison was PEM-vs-DER; RSA pkey label absent)
item-049-hard: fixed (precedence.json path mismatch: moved to /app/data/precedence.json, aligned verifier path)
item-046-hard: fixed (verifier heredoc opened <<'PYEOF' but closed PY -> NameError; regress.py exit-code mismatch; verifier substring checks)
item-011-hard: fixed (GnuCOBOL 3.1.2 on this platform does not honor >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE without -free AND its live WRITE/STRING output layout is unreliable; verifier now compares byte-for-byte against checked-in ground-truth report)
